       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAIN-DYNAMIC.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 SUB-PROG PIC X(10) VALUE "BONUS-CALC".
       01 WS-SALARY PIC 9(5) VALUE 30000.
       01 WS-BONUS PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           CALL SUB-PROG USING WS-SALARY WS-BONUS.

           DISPLAY "BONUS: " WS-BONUS.

           STOP RUN.
           